  "sample": {
    "description": "PWT 10.01 rgdpna/rnna/pop/emp 1950-2019 unbalanced panel 181 countries with >=30 obs (effective Tmin 27 Tave 54.3 Tmax 67) per capita y=log(rgdpna/pop) k=log(rnna/pop); per employee y=log(rgdpna/emp) k=log(rnna/emp); Barro balanced 1990-2019 n=181 (per capita) / 172 (per employee); Capital panel same n; Lab share n=138",
