    "differences": "Paper reports 157 countries with >=30 obs; replication obtains 181 per capita (172 per employee) under same >=30 rule from PWT 10.01; extra 24 territories/microstates not dropped (e.g., ABW, AIA, CUW, SXM etc.). Barro balanced n paper 157 vs replication 181 pc / 172 pe. Tmin/Tave/Tmax close (paper Tmin 27 Tave 55.2 Tmax 67 pc; replication Tmin 27 Tave 54.3 Tmax 67). Same period 1950-2019.",
